      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
        So I only know a little bit. But we can look up Python documentation
        anywhere.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
        The editor I have been using for the longest time is vscode, and I have
